      //
      // User: "along with me designing all the air taxi's I need to have
      // a manufacturing team. In the manufacturing window(CAD window)
      // have an option button to allow the AI team design an air taxi
      // of their choosing. I have to click on the button. It should be
      // the like same members who are out at the HUB."
      //
      // Flow:
      //   1. Roster populates from window.__buildCrewRoster() — cached on
      //      window.__opsCrewRoster so launchpad and mfg show the same names.
      //   2. User clicks button. We pick 2-3 members (prefer DISPATCH +
      //      MAINT + OPS) and mark them as the assigned design team.
      //   3. Pick a random AIRCRAFT_TEMPLATES key — the team is choosing
      //      the archetype, not the user.
      //   4. Run interpretDescription → executeBuildPlan (same pipeline
      //      as the existing "describe & generate" flow).
      //   5. Auto-save to the hangar with a tagged name (AI-LUXURY-A4B2 etc).
