            padScene.userData.queueCrewTask(s.role, {
              targetX: s.x,
              targetZ: s.z,
              // Stay on station long enough for the abort cruise +
              // descent to complete (~12s typical). Empirically the
              // abort phase runs 8-15s depending on how far out the
              // failure manifested; 12s holds them through most of
